  width: 100px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid gray;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin: 0 20px 20px 0;
  float: left;
}

.hover {
  background: #ffffd8;
}
```

</Sandpack>

As you can see, when one counter is updated, only the state for that component is updated:


<DiagramGroup>

.counter {
  width: 100px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid gray;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin: 0 20px 20px 0;
  float: left;
